15	// DEVDESK-412 step 4, hardening after review and security audit. These tests sit
16	// on top of oci_blob_redirect_test.go and reuse its fixtures:
17	//
18	//  1. a redirect chain sends no Referer (it would carry the previous hop's
19	//     signed URL to the next host);
20	//  2. https to http is refused against the PREVIOUS hop, not only the first one;
21	//  3. a non-http(s) Location, a 3xx without Location and the edge cases of
22	//     followBlobRedirect itself;
23	//  4. SSRF: a blob redirect to a literal loopback or link-local host, or to
24	//     localhost, is refused unless the registry itself is local, and the
25	//     transport refuses to connect to such an address (DNS rebinding);
26	//  5. a third host's HTTP status never reaches an error as raw text.
